<Defs>

  <!--
    EXPLOSIVE_PLANT_GROWTH_1 — the RM-tier roster: only plants and content this
    tier (or vanilla/DLC, or a gated donor looked up by name) owns. The
    campaign's own rows (RUT_/RSW_/donor flora the frozen world rosters) ship
    in the Utinni patch layer (mandrake.rut.patches, Defs/ExplosiveGrowth/).

    Source of every assignment: design/RimUtinni/explosive_plant_growth_roster.md
    (regenerated 2026-09-21 against ruling 4, water scarcity decides). CHURN is
    the default and is never listed. A row naming a plant that is not loaded is
    skipped silently and counted in the startup log line.

    SCOPE (owner, 2026-10-16): a BIOME scope. Rows only assign TOPS; any plant
    growing on a map whose biome Baroque Biomes ships runs the everyday bands and
    can soak. An unsupported option (off) extends both to every biome.

    ⛔ No biome decides a top. noSoakBiomes is the soak CARVE-OUT only
    (design doc §3) and is empty here: the RM tier names no campaign biome.
  -->
